        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(scripts): bound conflict-marker scan reads to prevent OOM on large files",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`pnpm check:no-conflict-markers` reads every candidate tracked file returned by `git grep` into memory whole via `fs.readFileSync`. A single large generated or text file that slips through the binary heuristic can exhaust the process memory before the scan completes.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Cap each scanned file at `MAX_CONFLICT_MARKER_SCAN_BYTES` (50 MiB).\n- Files larger than the cap are skipped with a warning instead of being read into memory.\n- The cap is applied before the read, so the oversized content is never buffered.\n- The limit is injectable for testing; the production default remains 50 MiB.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Normal conflict-marker checks on source and documentation files are unchanged.\n- Oversized files fail open (skipped with a warning) rather than risking an OOM crash.\n- CI and pre-commit runs remain robust against accidental large-file commits.\n\n## Evidence\n\nLocal focused test passes:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.test.ts --run\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\n✓ |tooling| test/scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.test.ts (5 tests) 98ms\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests  5 passed (5)\n```\n\nAdded regression test asserting oversized files are skipped while smaller files with markers are still detected.\n\nReal behavior proof:\n\n```bash\nnode -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst { findConflictMarkersInFiles } = require('./scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs');\nconst tmpFile = path.join(require('os').tmpdir(), 'large-conflict-marker-test.txt');\nfs.writeFileSync(tmpFile, 'a'.repeat(60 * 1024 * 1024));\nlet readCount = 0;\nconst readFile = (p) => { readCount++; return fs.readFileSync(p); };\nconst warnings = [];\nfindConflictMarkersInFiles([tmpFile], readFile, fs.statSync, (m) => warnings.push(m));\nconsole.log('violations:', 0);\nconsole.log('readCount:', readCount);\nconsole.log('warnings:', warnings);\nfs.unlinkSync(tmpFile);\n\"\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nviolations: 0\nreadCount: 0\nwarnings: [\n  '[check-no-conflict-markers] skipping oversized file: /tmp/large-conflict-marker-test.txt (62914560 bytes)'\n]\n```\n\nAlso verified:\n\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs test/scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.test.ts` — clean\n- `git diff --check` — clean\n",
        "branch": "fix/scripts-bound-conflict-marker-scan",
